================================================================================
PART 2 — EVERYTHING ELSE: Proprietary, all rights reserved
================================================================================

Applies to every path not listed in Part 1, including but not limited to:

  src/components/**, src/lib/**, src/hooks/**, src/styles/**
  src/pages/_app.jsx and src/pages/_document.jsx
  mdx/**            (the MDX build pipeline)
  scripts/**        (build-time generators)
  all build and configuration files
  public/logo.png
  public/screenshots/**

This material is proprietary. It is not open source and it is not
source-available. Publishing it here grants no licence to use, copy, modify,
merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, or sell any part of it.

Two parts of this are closed for reasons beyond a simple reservation of rights:

  - public/screenshots/** depict the Kryptic Platform dashboard, which is
    proprietary and unpublished.

  - src/styles/kryptic-tokens.css is a copy of the colour and typography tokens
    from @krypticdev/design-system, a proprietary Kryptic package published to a
    restricted npm scope and otherwise used only by the closed Kryptic clients.

The rest is simply reserved. Nothing in this section should be read as an
invitation to negotiate over individual files.

Forking this repository on GitHub in order to prepare a pull request is
expressly permitted, and so is running the site locally for that purpose. Any
other use of Part 2 material requires written permission.


